# Title: OpenREL Context Ontology Extension
# OpenREL Assertion, Request and Context Resolution Model
# Additive extension: load alongside the existing OpenREL schema, do not replace it.
# Canonical namespace: http://www.w3id.org/ns/openrel/0/
# Author: EOSC Beyond
